## 9. Revenue Streams
### Primary Revenue Model
- Model type (subscription, usage-based, commission, etc.)
- Pricing: specific tiers with prices
- Expected conversion rates (free → paid) with benchmarks from similar products
- ARPU (Average Revenue Per User) projection

### Revenue Projections (12 Months)
| Month | Users | Paid Users | Conv. Rate | ARPU | MRR | Cumulative Revenue |
|-------|-------|-----------|-----------|------|-----|--------------------|
| 1 | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |
| 3 | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |
| 6 | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |
| 12 | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |

### Unit Economics
- **LTV** (Lifetime Value): ARPU × Average lifespan (in months) × Gross margin
- **CAC** (Customer Acquisition Cost): By channel
- **LTV:CAC ratio**: Target > 3:1 for sustainable growth
- **Payback period**: Months to recover CAC

### Additional Revenue Opportunities
- Upsell / expansion revenue
- Enterprise / B2B tier
- API / platform fees
- Data insights (anonymized, if applicable)
- Advertising (if applicable — with trade-off analysis against user experience)

